# QA agent artifacts (screenshots, traces, videos) + state.json is a LIVE demo JWT — never commit
.playwright-mcp/
**/state.json
# Browser-automation artifacts belong in the MCP's --output-dir (~/Desktop/claude-smoke)
# or a scratchpad — NEVER the repo root. See .claude/rules/repo-hygiene.md §4.
#
# This block used to be `/*.png` alone. Playwright MCP writes **.jpeg** by default and
# dumps accessibility snapshots as .yml, so the guard silently missed both and 59 files
# accumulated at the root over weeks. Match the artifact SHAPE, not one guessed extension.
/*.png
/*.jpeg
/*.jpg
/*.webp
/*.gif
/*.pdf
# Playwright MCP accessibility snapshots (browser_snapshot) — `- generic [ref=...]` YAML
/*-snap*.yml
/*-snap*.yaml
/hud-snap*.yml
/*.har
/trace.zip
geoip/
.claude/worktrees/
# Playwright harness artifacts (tests/qa)
tests/qa/test-results/
tests/qa/playwright-report/
